     1,
     "<div>Hi Lorenzo,</div><div><br></div><div>The <span style=\"font-family:Courier New\">variable</span> argument needs to be a character object. I&#39;m guessing that <span style=\"font-family:Courier New\">variable=&quot;Var1&quot;</span> would probably work. <span style=\"font-family:Courier New\">Var1</span> does not reference a defined object outside of the list.</div><div><br></div><div>Tell me how the results come out. I&#39;m not sure how convinced I am by the method so far.<br></div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Chris<br></div>"
